	(text "Sink: 5.1 kohm Rd on CC1 and CC2 (USB Type-C spec 4.11). D+/D- joined across both rows\n(either plug orientation). USBLC6-2SC6 at the connector; D+/D- 90 ohm differential.\nShield to GND through R603 (0 ohm; an RC if EMC needs). VBUS -> D204 (sheet 2)."
